  "description": "A lightweight ASP.NET Core middleware for generating realistic mock API responses using local LLMs (via Ollama). Supports REST, GraphQL, SSE streaming, SignalR real-time data, and OpenAPI specs. NEW in v1.5.0: API Contexts for consistent multi-step workflows! Perfect for prototyping, demos, and testing. Compatible with .NET 8.0 and later.",
